  "post_content": "<p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; line-height: 16.899999618530273px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">La III Semana Cultural de Onda se ha iniciado oficialmente la noche de este viernes, con una gala inaugural en el Teatro M&oacute;naco y la posterior representaci&oacute;n de la obra El diario de Ad&aacute;n y Eva, con Fernando Guill&eacute;n Cuervo y Ana Mil&aacute;n. Este s&aacute;bado es el turno del &#39;Festival de Teatre de Carrer&#39;.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9099.jpg\" alt=\"img_9099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9100.jpg\" alt=\"img_9100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9104.jpg\" alt=\"img_9104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9106.jpg\" alt=\"img_9106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9107.jpg\" alt=\"img_9107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9110.jpg\" alt=\"img_9110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9111.jpg\" alt=\"img_9111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciiiisetmanculturalonda14/img_9117.jpg\" alt=\"img_9117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i